# Owner-sensitive strategic context — local-only by design, never commit.
# Carries personal/venture information that must not enter this public repo.
# If absent after a fresh clone, the canonical copy lives in the owner's ace-wiki.
docs/VENTURE-CONTEXT.md

# Traffic snapshots. Public repo: publishing traffic figures is a business
# decision, not a side effect of running a script.
analytics/

# Audit working files. Public repo: findings get triaged into commits and docs,
# not dumped wholesale.
audit-defects.json
audit-plan.md

# CaribStat harvested data. THE HARD RULE FOR THIS DIRECTORY.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC (verified: gh repo view asokore/statcite -> PUBLIC).
# caribstat/data/ holds ~27MB of ECCB and Central Bank of Barbados series whose
# published terms do NOT permit redistribution, which is exactly what StatCite's
# own licence ledger says at https://statcite.com/v1/sources: both sources are
# recorded as "not served ... its website terms do not permit the redistribution
# this service would perform."
#
# Committing that data here would perform the redistribution the ledger publicly
# says we refuse, turning a legal claim we make about ourselves into a false one.
# The code is public. The harvest is not, and does not become public when a
# grant arrives either — the ledger flip is the gate, and it is the operator's.
caribstat/data/
caribstat/*.log
caribstat/node_modules/
